fixture jump_on_dash_cling_frame_kicks_air_jump_spent
doc Control for jump_on_dash_cling_frame_kicks: the same with the air jump spent first. The press could only ever wait, and kicks off on the cling, the same outcome as with the air jump left.
room test/shaft
spawn 700 300
frames 40
input
  0 jump
  1 R dash
  2..4 R
  5 R jump
  6..39 R jump
end
expect
  at 0 event.air_jump=1
  at 1 event.dash=1
  at 5 event.wall_cling=1 event.wall_kick=1
end
